      "content": "i already checked my logs and my routines and there is literally nothing there. i've checked everything and it's like there's a ghost in the system. my ex used to be really tech savvy and he always loved making me feel like i was losing my mind with little things like this. the timing is just way too consistent for it to be a random bug. if he found a way to bypass the official logs or use a different hub to control them, how would i even detect that? can you help me write a script or something to log the actual real-time status of the devices so i can see the exact moment it happens?",
